window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-0b0d437b78cdf570"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"life-sciences\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">生命科学</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>使用 GPT-Rosalind 加速科学研究和药物发现。</p> <p>GPT-Rosalind 是 OpenAI 的前沿推理模型，旨在支持生物学、药物发现和转化医学研究。这一生命科学模型系列针对科学工作流进行了优化，在化学、蛋白质工程和基因组学方面结合了更强的工具使用能力与更深入的理解。目前，符合条件的用户可通过可信访问计划，在 ChatGPT、Codex 和 API 中以<a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">研究预览（需联网）</a>的形式使用 GPT-Rosalind。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 开展科学研究和分析。ChatGPT 可以将 GPT-Rosalind 和科学插件用于协作研究工作流；当工作需要编写代码、操作代码库、运行基准测试或反复进行软件实验时，则可使用 Codex。</p> <p><a id=\"life-sciences-research-analysis\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">生命科学研究与分析</h2> <p>使用 ChatGPT 将测序数据转化为可采取行动的生物学洞见，涵盖 bulk RNA-seq（批量 RNA 测序）、单细胞 RNA-seq 分析以及基于多来源证据的靶点优先级排序。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/target-prioritization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">确定药物靶点优先级（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 和 Life Science Research 插件规范化实体、检索遗传学……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">检查 bulk RNA-seq 输入（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 和 NGS Analysis 插件检查样本表、FASTQ 文件和参考……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">注释单细胞 RNA-seq 数据（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 和 NGS Analysis 插件处理 10x 风格的矩阵数据包，执行质量控制并……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"protein-folding-research-architecture-search\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">蛋白质折叠研究与架构搜索</h2> <p>使用 Codex 将蛋白质折叠假设转化为可审阅的实验迭代流程，并明确基准测试、可长期保留的产物和证据边界。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/discover-protein-folding-architectures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">探索蛋白质折叠模型（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 的 Goal Mode 研究并实现新颖的架构修改……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"life-sciences\">Life Sciences</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Use GPT-Rosalind to accelerate scientific research and drug discovery.</p> <p>GPT-Rosalind, our frontier reasoning model, is built to support research across biology, drug discovery, and translational medicine. This life sciences model series is optimized for scientific workflows, combining improved tool use with deeper understanding across chemistry, protein engineering, and genomics. Right now, GPT-Rosalind is available as a <a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">research preview (online)</a> in ChatGPT, Codex, and the API for qualified users through our trusted access program.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex for scientific research and analysis. ChatGPT can apply GPT-Rosalind and scientific plugins to shared research workflows; use Codex when the work requires code, a repository, benchmarks, or iterative software experiments.</p> <h2 id=\"life-sciences-research-analysis\">Life Sciences Research &amp; Analysis</h2> <p>Use ChatGPT to transform sequencing data into actionable biological insights, from bulk and single-cell RNA-seq analysis to multi-source target prioritization.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/target-prioritization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prioritize drug targets (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with the Life Science Research plugin to normalize entities, retrieve genetics...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Validate bulk RNA-seq inputs (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with the NGS Analysis plugin to validate sample sheets, FASTQs, and references...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Annotate scRNA-seq data (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with the NGS Analysis plugin to turn a 10x-style matrix bundle into QC-filtered...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"protein-folding-research-architecture-search\">Protein Folding Research &amp; Architecture Search</h2> <p>Use Codex to turn protein-folding hypotheses into reviewable experiment loops with explicit benchmarks, durable artifacts, and clear evidence boundaries.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/discover-protein-folding-architectures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discover protein folding models (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex with Goal Mode to research and implement novel architectural modifications to...</li> </ul>"};
